      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, you should never take a double dose of sumatriptan, as excessive doses can lead to severe side effects like heart issues or worsen symptoms. Instead, take only one pill now while resting in a quiet, dark room and applying a cold compress to your head. If the pain persists or you experience nausea/vomiting, call your healthcare provider for immediate advice or emergency care.",
