    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay well i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and i've had these before. i'm pretty sure it's just my usual migraine just being extra intense today. if i take one now and it doesnt work in an hour, can i take another one then? or should i just wait it out in the dark since i know that usually helps?",
